What is Self Service Technology?
Self service technology encompasses a wide range of interactive solutions that enable customers to complete transactions, access information, or self manage processes without direct staff assistance. Core embodiments include touch screen kiosks, automated teller machines, mobile ordering platforms, and RFID enabled dispensers. These systems integrate hardware interfaces with advanced software applications, generating real time data capture, analytics, and personalized experiences. By automating routine workflows, self service solutions enhance operational efficiency, reduce cost of labor, and expand service hours.
